---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | Bush Gums"
  description="How the Bush Gums website handles information."
  noindex
>
  <article class="content-page">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <h1>What happens to your information.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        This MVP keeps the decision tool in your browser and does not ask you to
        create an account or join a mailing list.
      </p>
      <h2>Questionnaire answers</h2><p>
        Build My Kit runs in your browser. Your answers are used to show a
        recommendation locally and are not deliberately sent to Bush Gums as
        questionnaire data. Clarity does not run on the Build My Kit page. There
        is no account system, saved-kit feature or active email capture.
      </p>
      <h2>Website analytics</h2><p>
        Bush Gums uses Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors interact
        with the website. It may provide aggregated usage information, heatmaps
        and session recordings of clicks, scrolling and navigation. We use these
        to improve the site's usability, navigation and content. Clarity may set
        cookies with a pseudonymous identifier. We do not intentionally use
        Clarity to identify individual visitors. Microsoft processes this
        information under its own <a
          href="https://www.microsoft.com/privacy/privacystatement"
          >privacy terms</a
        >. Microsoft says it retains recording playback for 30 days, or up to
        nine months for labeled or favorited sessions. It retains click and
        heatmap data for nine months.
      </p>
      <h2>External merchant links</h2><p>
        When you follow a merchant or affiliate link, the external merchant and
        any affiliate network may receive information about that visit and may
        use their own cookies or tracking. Review the external merchant’s
        privacy terms before purchasing.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact emails</h2><p>
        If you email Bush Gums, your message and address are handled by the
        configured email provider so we can respond. Do not include sensitive
        information that is not needed for your question.
      </p>
      <h2>What this site does not do</h2><p>
        This MVP has no account system, active email capture or questionnaire
        database. External merchant and affiliate tracking is separate from
        Clarity.
      </p>
      <p class="small-print">Last reviewed: 18 September 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
